 "sentences": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "take": "P",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 6.477,
   "text": "Lawyers ke paas hundreds of pages ke documents hote hain, handwritten notes hote hain, aur ek ek detail manually verify karni padti hai."
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "take": "P",
   "start": 6.7,
   "end": 8.94,
   "text": "What if AI yeh kaam thoda easy bana de?"
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "take": "P",
   "start": 9.166666666666666,
   "end": 14.293,
   "text": "Recently, I came across this platform called LawVriksh aur honestly iska concept kaafi easy hai."
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "take": "P",
   "start": 14.5,
   "end": 17.9,
   "text": "Maan lo aap ek lawyer ho aur aap ek complex case handle kar rahe ho."
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "take": "L",
   "start": 18.133333333333333,
   "end": 24.24,
   "text": "Multiple documents, conflicting facts, legal provisions, aur ek-ek detail manually verify karni padti hai."
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "take": "L",
   "start": 24.466666666666665,
   "end": 27.057,
   "text": "Aapko LawVriksh me apna document upload karna hai."
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "take": "L",
   "start": 27.266666666666666,
   "end": 33.337,
   "text": "AI important facts extract karega, unclear text highlight karega aur pure case ki mapping banayega."
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "take": "L",
   "start": 33.56666666666667,
   "end": 42.1,
   "text": "Agar different documents me conflicting fact hai toh you can compare them, verify the sources, aur pure case ki timeline aapko ek hi jagah dikh jayegi."
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "take": "L",
   "start": 42.6,
   "end": 56.567,
   "text": "Aur upcoming hearings ke liye iska hearing preparation features, previous records, important facts, aur case developments ko organize karne me help karta hai, jisse lawyers apne hearings aur arguments better way me prepare kar sakte hain."
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "take": "L",
   "start": 56.8,
   "end": 65.287,
   "text": "You can also ask questions about documents, generate legal drafts, you can also identify important points without manually reading every single page."
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "take": "P",
   "start": 66.03333333333333,
   "end": 69.63,
   "text": "As technology evolves, AI sirf coding tak limited nahi hai."
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "take": "P",
   "start": 69.86666666666666,
   "end": 73.903,
   "text": "It's changing different professions' work and law is one of them."
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "take": "P",
   "start": 74.13333333333334,
   "end": 77.263,
   "text": "And honestly, I think we are just getting started."
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "take": "L",
   "start": 77.5,
   "end": 83.573,
   "text": "Search LawVriksh on Google to find out more and comment LAW to get a DM with more details."
  }
 ],
